{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "7947cd5d168bd108277ad4d8957f6939614ea345435ae41a7664e2c2553289d7", "ja": "劇場の売店で売ってる\nサンドイッチって、\nけっこうおいしいよね。", "zh": "剧场贩卖部的三明治\n真的很好吃耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0c6d00bf80257dcc581c7cd81eec9e6e76a9b6f8ae9caf8470b3844072ffea7d", "ja": "具が日替わりで飽きないし……\n考えてたらお腹がすいちゃったな。\n買いに行こうかなぁ……。", "zh": "每天都会换不同的馅料，完全吃不腻……\n想着想着肚子就饿了。\n要去买三明治吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e14dd4912d7581af64b92188b1df226deaaf777ebb2b732c819cde5b67d6b3de", "ja": "あっ、いけない！\n{$P$}Pさんを\n探してたんだった！", "zh": "啊，不对！\n我在找{$P$}P先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "9ab94117eb1742308173e3615fea6b9fa80048d5747e174dd882c1d0b2db34be", "ja": "何か食べるのは、\n用事が終わった後にしよーっと。", "zh": "要吃东西还是\n等事情办完之后再吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
